{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:4b21ebff52639c9b","name":"Tempest","source":{"id":"source:reference-4b21ebff52639c9b","title":"Tempest","revision":19793,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:36:50Z","sha256":"fffea65af9f49f57c9068fb050cc6067050e8cd55e64c7b97bea40a9a61a79ba","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19793","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Tempest&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-4b21ebff52639c9b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A character that consumes Tempest gains the ability to Rage (see below). However, taking more than one dose of Tempest in a 24-hour period immediately moves the user -4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," steps down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},"; if this moves the user to the bottom of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},", he or she dies. The ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," can only be removed by resting for 8 hours.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Rage: "]},"Once per day, a character can fly into a Rage as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". While Raging, the user temporarily gains a +2 Rage bonus on melee attack rolls and melee damage rolls, but cannot use ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," that require patience and concentration, such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},". A fit of Rage lasts for a number of rounds equal to 5 + the character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," modifier.\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":["At the end of its Rage, the user moves -1 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent"}," step along the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"},". The penalties imposed by this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persistent Condition"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persistent_Condition"}," persist until the individual takes at least 10 minutes to recuperate, during which time the user can't engage in any strenuous activity."]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
